{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "basis": "Engine usage, summary and implementation inspected at the pinned 0.10.2 commit. Scope and effects describe what the command does, not what Mona has wired yet. support=runtime-api means a documented /v1 operation exists for R04 to call; support=terminal-only means only the TUI implements it; support=unavailable means 0.10.2 exposes no route.",
